      "text": {
        "html": "<div class=\"article-rich-text\"><p data-w-id=\"ce1eaab2-f825-f2ff-88fb-3318faeddd78\">If you’ve reached this point, great job—you’re making progress.<a data-wf-link-page-id=\"66d6e11b9d5c09c36c85ff11\" data-w-id=\"d2bbc663-35a3-9b83-3eac-2559083752cd\">‍</a></p><p data-w-id=\"19d3111b-554d-1054-dc38-c3ce8e6ac7a8\">After <a data-wf-link-page-id=\"66d6e11b9d5c09c36c85ff11\" data-w-id=\"3ee3fe66-820c-7af1-22d8-595fb132ee3a\">creating something valuable</a>, <a data-wf-link-page-id=\"66d6e6405e4aaf11d4bfcc75\" data-w-id=\"a742e537-3226-3c76-773f-57834c31b971\">finding your audience</a>, and monetizing your work, it’s time to take next step.</p><blockquote data-w-id=\"ef6d4efa-280d-8661-8921-6c295bfcb4bb\">Elevate your journey with a balanced mind-body approach, using strategies, systems, and analytics to <a data-wf-link-page-id=\"676ac6b1b4c345c7e99d2f54\" data-w-id=\"c4ca2afe-b50a-0b02-d71a-6c3af69e3936\">expand your impact and income</a>.</blockquote></div>",
